From c0005f3aff375b984777728ebd2eab1949e8525f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:06:38 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 39/59] game.xvt_lasers: XvT's bolt speed, lifetime, launch
 point and gun positions

- Cannon bolts take XvT's g_projectileDamageByObjectType values instead of
  doubling X-Wing's: lasers 2000/1800 for 1 s (1.5 s charged), ions 1400 for
  1.5 s and 1600 for 2 s charged (they were 700/750 for 2.5 s). Bolts start
  921 units ahead of the gun, not 2048.
- Starship turrets fire at the same speeds for three times the lifetime, as
  XvT's turrets do.
- xvt_hardpoints.c: XvT's gun positions where its OPTs override the static
  table it shares with X-Wing (fediskio.c): X-Wing, B-Wing (Balance of Power
  OPT), TIE fighter, TIE interceptor and shuttle, in XvT's slot order. The
  TIE Advanced (4 guns in XvT, 2 in X-Wing) and capital ships keep X-Wing's.
  Used when firing and by the HUD in-range check; not in DOS flight.
- Charged shots stay Rebel-only (XvT and XWA give them to every craft).
